cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "stockout: retail sales and product demand prediction"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Tejas
    family-names: Deshmane
    email: tejasdeshmane66@gmail.com
repository-code: "https://github.com/Surge77/stockout"
url: "https://github.com/Surge77/stockout"
abstract: >-
  Retail sales and product demand prediction. Given a store and a day, the package
  predicts that store-day's sales and classifies it as Low, Medium or High demand,
  from store attributes, calendar position, promotions and holidays. Every model sits
  behind the same preprocessing pipeline and is scored on the same held-out rows, so
  the estimator is the only thing that varies between rows of the results table.
keywords:
  - retail
  - demand-prediction
  - sales-forecasting
  - regression
  - classification
  - scikit-learn
